BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:r-old-time-jam-20261112@same-time-next-week
DTSTAMP:20261113T193023Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261112T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261112T210000
SUMMARY:PineCone Old-Time Jam
LOCATION:Riparian Provision Company\, 1408 S Saunders St\, Raleigh\, NC 276
 03
DESCRIPTION:Circle jam of old-time fiddle tunes led by strong players who l
 eave room for newer ones. Listeners are welcome too. The same regulars com
 e every month.\n\nUp-to-speed jam (not a slow or learning jam)\; tunes are
  called by key (D\, A\, G)\n\nHow to join: Just show up with an instrument
 \, or come to listen\n\nBefore you go: Next dates are Dec 10\, Jan 14 and 
 Feb 11\, though only Dec 10 is on PineCone's calendar so far. Parking at t
 he plaza is very limited.\n\nhttps://pinecone.org/event/pinecone-old-time-
 jam-at-riparian-6/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://pinecone.org/event/pinecone-old-time-jam-at-riparian-6/
END:VEVENT
