DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261123T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261123T210000
SUMMARY:PineCone Open Bluegrass Jam
LOCATION:Raleigh Brewing Company\, 3709 Neil St\, Raleigh\, NC 27607
DESCRIPTION:Up-to-speed open circle jam on standard bluegrass songs for mus
 icians of all levels. It moved to Raleigh Brewing in September 2026.\n\nHo
 w to join: Just show up with your instrument\n\nBefore you go: Posted date
 s: Nov 23\, Dec 28\, Jan 25\, Feb 22.\n\nhttps://pinecone.org/event/pineco
 ne-open-bluegrass-jam-9/2026-11-23/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
