DESCRIPTION:Weekly all-paces run/walk with a social pint afterward\, plus o
 ccasional themed runs such as the zombie run and ugly sweater run.\n\n3-4 
 mile greenway route (Meredith campus to the NC Museum of Art and back)\, t
 hen a pint\n\nHow to join: Just show up\; RSVP on Meetup is optional\n\nBe
 fore you go: The next one is listed on Meetup for Nov 18.\n\nhttps://www.m
 eetup.com/raleigh-brewing-walk-cycle-run-trivia-fun/\n\nListed on Same Tim
 e Next Week.
URL:https://www.meetup.com/raleigh-brewing-walk-cycle-run-trivia-fun/
END:VEVENT
