DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261111T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261111T200000
SUMMARY:Food Bank warehouse sort (Wednesday evening)
LOCATION:Food Bank of Central & Eastern NC - Raleigh Branch\, 1924 Capital 
 Blvd\, Raleigh\, NC 27604 (volunteer entrance currently at 2439 Crabtree B
 lvd)
DESCRIPTION:Check and repack donated food into family-sized boxes alongside
  other volunteers. This is the only after-work session at the Raleigh ware
 house.\n\nWednesday also has 9-11:30am and 1-3:30pm sessions\n\nHow to joi
 n: Online registration is required: use the volunteer calendar on the Rale
 igh location page\n\nBefore you go: Check the holiday weeks (Nov 25\, Dec 
 23\, Dec 30). Ages 12+\, under 16 with an adult.\n\nhttps://foodbankcenc.o
 rg/locations/raleigh/\n\nListed on Same Time Next Week.
URL:https://foodbankcenc.org/locations/raleigh/
END:VEVENT
